#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:208
msgid ""
"A pool is a named range of virtual IP addresses that the IKE daemon hands "
"out to remote peers (road warriors) when they connect, so that they get an "
"address inside your network."
msgstr ""
"地址池是虚拟 IP 地址的命名区间，IKE daemon 程序在远程对等方（经常出差在外的"
"人）连接时将池子信息交出去以便这些人可以获得你网络内部的一个地址。"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:87
msgid ""
